==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 33.33~46.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,400f</sup>.
*3 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Sonic (Enemy)|Sonic]] spawns as the boss after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns after 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>.
*3 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 0.67~1.33 seconds<sup>20f~40f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

